# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card S2 serving window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of serving/tp4-s2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled
# in by whoever drives the window; every other value is final. ORDER.txt says the order, each job's image and its stop rule.
# A POST-EVIDENCE job: image tp4-serve-1, built from the commit that records packed_any_evidence_tp4.json (the record is baked into
# the image, so the image is built AFTER it), serving c2-packed-tp4, the TRAFFIC profile and the image default: the attach is
# admitted by the record and a missing or stale record is a refusal, never a fallback.
# SS: the traffic-profile smoke: warmup, coding, a long real-text prompt, four concurrent users (and the steady and resend
# variants), a tool call, the n=2 refusal, both alive checks, a dropped stream, and the two STREAMED tests (the only path parser M
# re-chunks): stream_tool_call (tool_calls in the deltas, no <tool_call> in the content) and stream_reasoning (reasoning_content
# non-empty, no </think> in the content). READ the log, not only the verdict: '[PINDIAG] packed-any admission passed:' with the CB1,
# CB2a and CB2b run ids and NO UNQUALIFIED line; the parser-rechunk (parser M) arm line; the four-card prefill warm line BEFORE
# Metal's unsafe-allocation warning and no late prefill programs; ready within the agent's 1020 s ceiling (every four-card smoke
# so far: 105-150 s).
# Duration (estimate): 15-20 min. Stop rule: a refusal at attach, any failed test, an UNQUALIFIED line or a late program stops the window.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,steady_resend,tool_call,stream_tool_call,stream_reasoning,refused_n2,alive_after_refusal,stream_dropped,alive_after_drop
